'''Bonus Stage''' is the [[Continuation Stage]] the player can try whenever they beat a stage in [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event#Green Hill Zone|Green Hill Zone]], [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event#Chemical Plant Zone|Chemical Plant Zone]] or [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event#Sky Sanctuary|Sky Sanctuary]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

